Interactive native Husarz regression over real HTTP, USB input and BWS. Boots
the built ISO read-only, without guest data disks. An isolated loopback HTTP
server supplies fixtures through QEMU's guestfwd virtual HTTP endpoint. No
browser or kernel test entry points are installed. Screenshots observe native
controls.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --bios                Boot the production ISO through SeaBIOS and its CD
                        boot path
  --iso ISO
  --kernel KERNEL       Matching unmodified kernel ELF for symbol observation
                        and artifact hashing
  --installed-disk INSTALLED_DISK
                        Private disposable .bsf-test/*.img; disk-only font
                        persistence test
  --expected-font-size EXPECTED_FONT_SIZE
                        Assert restored native config before changing anything
  --font-restore-only   Observe restored Settings without applying another
                        change
  --output OUTPUT
  --system-windows-phase {full,core,late}
  --system-windows-only
                        System identity, rounded corners and concurrent
                        Settings apps
  --power-png-fonts-only
                        Native font matrix for Start PNG icons and measured
                        popup
  --power-png-failures-only
                        Isolated malformed system icon fixtures with release
                        UI code
  --settings-themes-power-only
                        Native Settings themes lifecycle and Start power popup
  --gui-regressions-only
                        Desktop rubber-band frames and native slider demo
  --display-input {usb,virtio,ps2}
  --display-geometry-only
                        Immediate release display transaction and desktop
                        round trips
  --clock-support-only  Atomic clock frames and native Support/Refresh/font
                        update acceptance
  --desktop-grid-restore DESKTOP_GRID_RESTORE
                        Previous grid result directory for disk-only reboot
                        coordinate comparison
  --desktop-grid-only   Exact image-anchor comparison over repeated live font-
                        family changes
  --desktop-ui-only     Desktop selection, fixed Start search/power region and
                        Settings font sizes
  --fonts-only          Native BSF alpha typography and Settings font page
  --native-font-apps    Also exercise Notepad, Calculator and Explorer across
                        the font update
  --font-fallback-only  Readable native bitmap fallback with rejected font
                        assets
  --theme-only          Focused desktop/web theme isolation and navigation
                        cancellation regression
  --css-only            External CSS redirects, variables, pixels, flex/media
                        resize and cancellation
  --real-css            Observe public Tomato and WordPress pages; Internet
                        required, no deterministic PASS assertion
  --tomato-only         Observe only the requested real Tomato page
  --timeout TIMEOUT
  --diagnostics-only    Development counters observed through serial, without
                        screenshot polling during work
  --font-profile-only   BSF_PROFILE=1 HUSARZ_PERF=1 private build: desktop and
                        repeated heavy-page native timings
  --performance         Heavy supported pages, repeated maximize/restore,
                        cancellation and long scrolling
  --layout-only         Native table spans, border conflict and signed margin
                        pixels with resize
  --render-only         Development pass over resources, forms and theme
                        isolation
  --scroll-only         Release scrolling, refresh anchoring, resize and
                        history regression
  --javascript-forms-only
                        Focused native JavaScript form and keyboard diagnostic
  --javascript-cancellation-only
                        Focused pending async fetch navigation and tab-close
                        cancellation
  --javascript-storage-only
                        Focused ordinary-ISO storage persistence and isolation
                        acceptance
  --modern-javascript-only
                        New FPU/modern JavaScript acceptance; run
                        --javascript-only separately for existing JS
                        regression
  --modern-javascript   Binary64, prototypes, exceptions, Promise/async,
                        fetch/JSON and storage plus existing JS regression
  --javascript-only     Native bounded JavaScript, DOM, events, forms, timers
                        and external cache
  --font-size-matrix-only
  --live-font-install-only
  --font-resources-only
  --expected-font-count EXPECTED_FONT_COUNT
  --expected-resident-bytes EXPECTED_RESIDENT_BYTES
  --terminal-unicode-only
                        Production Terminal TTF/grid/grapheme editing, byte
                        output and bitmap recovery
  --unicode-trace-only  Private diagnostic: capture one native left command,
                        no acceptance verdict
  --unicode-editing-only
                        Native browser cluster editing and Notepad save/reopen
                        verified through clipboard/form bytes
  --editing-only        Release UTF-8 selection, OS clipboard, password
                        protection and GIF pixels
  --images-only         Focused native PNG/JPEG pixels and shared-cache
                        regression
  --fault-vector {6,14}
  --fault-probe FAULT_PROBE
                        Private test kernel with a deliberately faulting Ring
                        3 browser payload
